  "name": "Trap Cover",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Use this skill when a target other than yourself receives damage from a Prop or [Gimmick]. During the [Damage Apply Step], you receive the expected HP damage that the target would have received. The target receives no damage. You can only use this skill once in response to any given attack.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that protects allies from damage caused by traps and the like, and accepts the damage instead.</p>",
